ZVSE2

** AURELIUS - SPECIALTY ICON CLICK (option 953)
**
** Advanced Classes Mod shows its own specialty text when the specialty icon of Roland (152) is
** clicked. The "30" prefix makes this handler run before the Advanced Classes one: it shows
** Aurelius' text and changes the click type, so the Advanced Classes handlers exit without
** showing theirs.

!?CM2&i^aur_enabled^;
!!CM:F?(flags:y) I?(item:y) S?(subtype:y) T?(type:y);
!!FU|(item)<>118/(type)<>512/(subtype)=13:E;   [not a click on the specialty icon]
!!FU&(flags)<>0/(flags)<>512:E;                [not a left or right click]

!!HE(CURRENT_HERO):N?(hero:y);
!!FU&(hero)<>(HERO_ROLAND):E;          [Aurelius (Roland slot)]

!!CM:R0 T0;                                    [disable standard reaction, hide click from later handlers]

!!VR(text:z):S^{Dark Phoenix Evolution}

Aurelius can evolve Divine Phoenixes in his army into Dark Phoenixes, anywhere on the map. The cost is the price difference between the two creatures.^;

!!VR(msgType:y):S(MSG_TYPE_MES);
!!VR(msgType)&(flags)=512:S(MSG_TYPE_POPUP);
!!IF:M1/(msgType)/(text);
